    "Ridgeland",
    "Magnolia Health is contracted with the Mississippi Division of Medicaid to provide services for beneficiaries in the MississippiCAN and Children’s Health Insurance Programs. As part of the MississippiCAN program, we serve selected Medicaid populations, which include SSI, TANF, foster care and pregnant women and infants.",
    "Learn more about Magnolia HealthExternal Link",
    "Medicaid",
    "In MIssissippi, Wellcare offers a range of Medicare products, including Medicare Advantage Prescription Drug plans (MAPD), Medicare Advantage only plans (MA only), Dual Eligible Special Needs Plans (DSNP) and standalone Prescription Drug Plans (PDP). Our Medicare Advantage plans offer affordable coverage beyond Original Medicare, including a range of benefits such as dental, hearing, and vision services; transportation and fitness services; Spendables® Cards; and other wellness programs to help our members live better, healthier lives. Wellcare's standalone PDPs help cover the cost of prescription drugs including low monthly premiums and copays; access to a broad pharmacy network; and convenient delivery of medications. Not all benefits are available in all plans, view plans in your area.",
    "Learn more about WellcareExternal Link",
    "Medicare Advantage Prescription Drug plans (MAPD)",
    "Medicare Advantage only plans (MA)",
    "Dual Eligible Special Needs Plans (DSNP)",
    "Prescription Drug Plans (PDP)",
    "With quality healthcare solutions, Ambetter from Magnolia Health helps residents of Mississippi live better. And now, it’s easier to stay covered with our Health Insurance Marketplace insurance plan: Ambetter Health.",
    "In addition to on-exchange marketplace plans, Ambetter Health offers off-exchange individual health insurance plans that are compatible with Individual Coverage Health Reimbursement Arrangements (ICHRA).",
